        "Content": "AN EXCELLENT INVESTMENT BY ANY STANDARDS…\r\nTHIS PROPERTY AND SITE HAS TRULY EXCEPTIONAL POTENTIAL…\r\n\r\nPERFECT TRANQUILITY IN A BEAUTIFUL SETTING WITH AMENITIES NEARBY AND DUBLIN CITY ON YOUR DOORSTEP A SIMPLY SUPERB FOUR BEDROOM DETACHED BUNGALOW WITH GARAGE SITUATED ON A LARGE SITE IN THE HIGHLY SOUGHT AFTER NEIGHBOURHOOD OF KILMARTIN HOLLYSTOWN DUBLIN 15\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING IS STRONGLY ADVISED...\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Dublin 15 Property Specialists are delighted to present Kilmartin to the Hollystown property market. Located in a secluded position however with every conceivable amenity easily accessible.\r\n\r\nA generous front driveway welcomes you to this special family home. Kilmartin will no doubt appeal to first time buyers, investors and parties trading up / downsizing alike. This wonderful property has been tastefully decorated and well maintained so it is in walk in condition throughout. \r\n\r\nThe floor plan briefly consists of: Entrance hall, living room, lounge room, kitchen / dining room, utility room, four bedrooms, guest wc and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nA sliding door opens to invite you into this simply charming bungalow. The front living room is flooded with natural light and features a modern fireplace. The separate lounge room at the rear is both bright and airy. The spacious kitchen / dining room offers an abundance of worktop area and extensive storage space. All of the four bedrooms are generous. The family bathroom is fully tiled. This property has quality glazing throughout and a top grade heating system. \r\n\r\nAnother bonus is the separate garage which could be easily converted into a home office.\r\n\r\nAdded to this the sunny back garden offers the perfect space to relax and/or entertain. \r\n\r\n*The site offers development potential. Further information available upon request.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within a 15 minute drive of Dublin International Airport. Blanchardstown and Castleknock Villages are within close proximity. Also the Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is within easy reach. There are many recreational and sports amenities literally on your doorstep. Leisure activities including National Aquatic Centre and Sports Campus Ireland are in the Dublin 15 locality. Dublin 15's Corporate Parks and Connolly Hospital are also close by. The Phoenix Park and Castleknock Village are within a 15 minute drive. The property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families. The area is further serviced by a nearby local bus service making the city most accessible. The M50 / M3 /M2 are all close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised…\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
